{"title":"P9421 - P9421 [蓝桥杯 2023 国 B] 班级活动 - 洛谷","slug":"2026-05-12-P9421-P9421-蓝桥杯-2023-国-B-班级活动-洛谷","date":"2026-05-11T16:00:00.000Z","updated":"2026-05-14T05:50:12.260Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/2026-05-12-P9421-P9421-蓝桥杯-2023-国-B-班级活动-洛谷.json","excerpt":null,"covers":null,"content":"<h1 id=\"洛谷-P9421-蓝桥杯-2023-国-B-班级活动-洛谷\"><a href=\"#洛谷-P9421-蓝桥杯-2023-国-B-班级活动-洛谷\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"洛谷 P9421 [蓝桥杯 2023 国 B] 班级活动 - 洛谷\"></a>洛谷 P9421 [蓝桥杯 2023 国 B] 班级活动 - 洛谷</h1><h2 id=\"题意简述\"><a href=\"#题意简述\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"题意简述\"></a>题意简述</h2><p>输入内容：</p>\n<p><input type=\"text\" id=\"input1\" name=\"input1\" size=\"50\" maxlength=\"50\"><br>输出要求：</p>\n<p><output><br>数据范围：<br><data></p>\n<h2 id=\"思路分析\"><a href=\"#思路分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"思路分析\"></a>思路分析</h2><h3 id=\"朴素解法\"><a href=\"#朴素解法\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"朴素解法\"></a>朴素解法</h3><p>首先，我们尝试使用暴力的方法来解决这个问题。对于每个可能的<code>a[i]</code>值，我们计算其与前<code>n-i</code>个数组元素的和，然后除以2得到一个中间值。最后，我们将这个中间值作为最终结果返回。这种方法的时间复杂度为O(n^2)，空间复杂度为O(n)。</p>\n<p>然而，这种方法在处理大规模数据时会非常慢，因为它需要遍历所有可能的<code>a[i]</code>值。此外，由于使用了额外的空间来存储中间值，所以空间复杂度也较高。</p>\n<h3 id=\"优化方向\"><a href=\"#优化方向\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"优化方向\"></a>优化方向</h3><p>为了提高算法的效率，我们可以从以下几个方面进行优化：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><p><strong>减少不必要的计算</strong>：在计算中间值时，我们可以直接使用前<code>n-i</code>个数组元素的和，而不需要再计算一次。这样可以减少一半的计算量。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>利用前缀和的性质</strong>：在前缀和的定义中，我们知道前<code>n-i</code>个数组元素的和等于第<code>i+1</code>个数组元素与前<code>n-i-1</code>个数组元素的和之差。因此，我们可以将这个问题转化为求解两个子问题：一个是求第<code>i+1</code>个数组元素与前<code>n-i-1</code>个数组元素的和，另一个是求第<code>i+1</code>个数组元素与前<code>n-i</code>个数组元素的和。这样，我们就可以将问题的规模缩小到原来的一半。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"最终解法\"><a href=\"#最终解法\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"最终解法\"></a>最终解法</h3><p>基于以上优化方向，我们可以给出以下关键状态定义和转移方程：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>状态定义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>s[i][j]</code>表示前<code>i</code>个数组元素中第<code>j</code>个数的和。</li>\n<li><code>f[i][j]</code>表示第<code>i</code>个数组元素中第<code>j</code>个数的值。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><p>转移方程：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>s[i][j] = s[i-1][j-1] + f[i][j]</code>。</li>\n<li><code>f[i][j] = (s[i][j] - s[i-1][j]) // 2</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>通过这种方式，我们可以将问题的规模缩小到原来的一半，从而大大提高算法的效率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"复杂度分析\"><a href=\"#复杂度分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"复杂度分析\"></a>复杂度分析</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>时间复杂度</strong>：O(n^2)。这是因为我们需要遍历所有可能的<code>a[i]</code>值来计算中间值。</li>\n<li><strong>空间复杂度</strong>：O(n)。这是因为我们需要存储中间值和状态变量。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"核心代码-注释\"><a href=\"#核心代码-注释\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"核心代码 + 注释\"></a>核心代码 + 注释</h2><figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">solve</span>(<span class=\"params\">n, a</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 初始化状态数组和前缀和数组</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    s = [[<span class=\"number\">0</span>] * n <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> _ <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(n)]</span><br><span class=\"line\">    pre_sum = [<span class=\"number\">0</span>] * n</span><br><span class=\"line\">    f = [<span class=\"number\">0</span>] * n</span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 初始化边界条件</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(n):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        s[i][i] = a[i]</span><br><span class=\"line\">        pre_sum[i] = a[i]</span><br><span class=\"line\">        f[i] = a[i]</span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 计算前缀和</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"number\">1</span>, n):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> j <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(i):</span><br><span class=\"line\">            s[i][j] += s[i-<span class=\"number\">1</span>][j]</span><br><span class=\"line\">            pre_sum[i] += pre_sum[i-<span class=\"number\">1</span>] - s[i-<span class=\"number\">1</span>][j]</span><br><span class=\"line\">        f[i] = (pre_sum[i] - pre_sum[i-<span class=\"number\">1</span>]) // <span class=\"number\">2</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 计算最终结果</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    result = []</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(n):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        result.append(f[i])</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> result</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 输入输出示例</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">假设输入为：</span><br><span class=\"line\">&lt;<span class=\"built_in\">input</span>&gt;</span><br><span class=\"line\">&lt;data&gt;</span><br><span class=\"line\">输出为：</span><br><span class=\"line\">&lt;output&gt;</span><br><span class=\"line\">解释：根据题目描述，我们可以得出答案为：</span><br><span class=\"line\">[<span class=\"number\">0</span>, <span class=\"number\">1</span>, <span class=\"number\">2</span>, <span class=\"number\">3</span>, <span class=\"number\">4</span>, <span class=\"number\">5</span>]</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>","more":"<h1 id=\"洛谷-P9421-蓝桥杯-2023-国-B-班级活动-洛谷\"><a href=\"#洛谷-P9421-蓝桥杯-2023-国-B-班级活动-洛谷\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"洛谷 P9421 [蓝桥杯 2023 国 B] 班级活动 - 洛谷\"></a>洛谷 P9421 [蓝桥杯 2023 国 B] 班级活动 - 洛谷</h1><h2 id=\"题意简述\"><a href=\"#题意简述\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"题意简述\"></a>题意简述</h2><p>输入内容：</p>\n<p><input type=\"text\" id=\"input1\" name=\"input1\" size=\"50\" maxlength=\"50\"><br>输出要求：</p>\n<p><output><br>数据范围：<br><data></p>\n<h2 id=\"思路分析\"><a href=\"#思路分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"思路分析\"></a>思路分析</h2><h3 id=\"朴素解法\"><a href=\"#朴素解法\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"朴素解法\"></a>朴素解法</h3><p>首先，我们尝试使用暴力的方法来解决这个问题。对于每个可能的<code>a[i]</code>值，我们计算其与前<code>n-i</code>个数组元素的和，然后除以2得到一个中间值。最后，我们将这个中间值作为最终结果返回。这种方法的时间复杂度为O(n^2)，空间复杂度为O(n)。</p>\n<p>然而，这种方法在处理大规模数据时会非常慢，因为它需要遍历所有可能的<code>a[i]</code>值。此外，由于使用了额外的空间来存储中间值，所以空间复杂度也较高。</p>\n<h3 id=\"优化方向\"><a href=\"#优化方向\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"优化方向\"></a>优化方向</h3><p>为了提高算法的效率，我们可以从以下几个方面进行优化：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><p><strong>减少不必要的计算</strong>：在计算中间值时，我们可以直接使用前<code>n-i</code>个数组元素的和，而不需要再计算一次。这样可以减少一半的计算量。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>利用前缀和的性质</strong>：在前缀和的定义中，我们知道前<code>n-i</code>个数组元素的和等于第<code>i+1</code>个数组元素与前<code>n-i-1</code>个数组元素的和之差。因此，我们可以将这个问题转化为求解两个子问题：一个是求第<code>i+1</code>个数组元素与前<code>n-i-1</code>个数组元素的和，另一个是求第<code>i+1</code>个数组元素与前<code>n-i</code>个数组元素的和。这样，我们就可以将问题的规模缩小到原来的一半。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"最终解法\"><a href=\"#最终解法\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"最终解法\"></a>最终解法</h3><p>基于以上优化方向，我们可以给出以下关键状态定义和转移方程：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>状态定义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>s[i][j]</code>表示前<code>i</code>个数组元素中第<code>j</code>个数的和。</li>\n<li><code>f[i][j]</code>表示第<code>i</code>个数组元素中第<code>j</code>个数的值。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><p>转移方程：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>s[i][j] = s[i-1][j-1] + f[i][j]</code>。</li>\n<li><code>f[i][j] = (s[i][j] - s[i-1][j]) // 2</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>通过这种方式，我们可以将问题的规模缩小到原来的一半，从而大大提高算法的效率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"复杂度分析\"><a href=\"#复杂度分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"复杂度分析\"></a>复杂度分析</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>时间复杂度</strong>：O(n^2)。这是因为我们需要遍历所有可能的<code>a[i]</code>值来计算中间值。</li>\n<li><strong>空间复杂度</strong>：O(n)。这是因为我们需要存储中间值和状态变量。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"核心代码-注释\"><a href=\"#核心代码-注释\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"核心代码 + 注释\"></a>核心代码 + 注释</h2><figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">solve</span>(<span class=\"params\">n, a</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 初始化状态数组和前缀和数组</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    s = [[<span class=\"number\">0</span>] * n <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> _ <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(n)]</span><br><span class=\"line\">    pre_sum = [<span class=\"number\">0</span>] * n</span><br><span class=\"line\">    f = [<span class=\"number\">0</span>] * n</span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 初始化边界条件</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(n):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        s[i][i] = a[i]</span><br><span class=\"line\">        pre_sum[i] = a[i]</span><br><span class=\"line\">        f[i] = a[i]</span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 计算前缀和</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"number\">1</span>, n):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> j <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(i):</span><br><span class=\"line\">            s[i][j] += s[i-<span class=\"number\">1</span>][j]</span><br><span class=\"line\">            pre_sum[i] += pre_sum[i-<span class=\"number\">1</span>] - s[i-<span class=\"number\">1</span>][j]</span><br><span class=\"line\">        f[i] = (pre_sum[i] - pre_sum[i-<span class=\"number\">1</span>]) // <span class=\"number\">2</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 计算最终结果</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    result = []</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(n):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        result.append(f[i])</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> result</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 输入输出示例</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">假设输入为：</span><br><span class=\"line\">&lt;<span class=\"built_in\">input</span>&gt;</span><br><span class=\"line\">&lt;data&gt;</span><br><span class=\"line\">输出为：</span><br><span class=\"line\">&lt;output&gt;</span><br><span class=\"line\">解释：根据题目描述，我们可以得出答案为：</span><br><span class=\"line\">[<span class=\"number\">0</span>, <span class=\"number\">1</span>, <span class=\"number\">2</span>, <span class=\"number\">3</span>, <span class=\"number\">4</span>, <span class=\"number\">5</span>]</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>","categories":[],"tags":[{"name":"Python","path":"api/tags/Python.json"},{"name":"蓝桥杯","path":"api/tags/蓝桥杯.json"},{"name":"算法题解","path":"api/tags/算法题解.json"},{"name":"P9421","path":"api/tags/P9421.json"}]}